	(text_box "Note: \n\n1uF capactior at EN pint togeter with 10K pullup form RC delay recomended by datasheet\nBoot GIPOS: GPIO0, GPIO3 GPIO45, GPIO046\n\n\nSafe: \nIO4  4  I/O/T RTC_GPIO4,  GPIO4,  TOUCH4, ADC1_CH3\nIO5  5  I/O/T RTC_GPIO5,  GPIO5,  TOUCH5, ADC1_CH4\nIO6  6  I/O/T RTC_GPIO6,  GPIO6,  TOUCH6, ADC1_CH5\nIO7  7  I/O/T RTC_GPIO7,  GPIO7,  TOUCH7, ADC1_CH6\nIO17 10 I/O/T RTC_GPIO17, GPIO17, U1TXD,  ADC2_CH6\n\nExternal Crystal\nIO15 8 I/O/T RTC_GPIO15, GPIO15, U0RTS, ADC2_CH4, XTAL_32K_P\nIO16 9 I/O/T RTC_GPIO16, GPIO16, U0CTS, ADC2_CH5, XTAL_32K_N\n\nMTDI, MTCK, MTMS, and MTDO.\n\nTODO: \n\n- [x] Move Leds to the botton, so there is a place for a crystal\n- [x] Add clock crystal\n- [x] Add voltage measurement - resistor divider to A0\n- [x] Add Jtag port for debug\n- [x] Add protected GPIO \n- [x] Add internal memory\n- [x] Enreach silk-skreen \n- [x] Add testpoints\n- [x] Update JLC BOM\n\n- [x] Test measurement with GND reference (47R + 1nF)\n- [x] Test measuremnt with resistors and cpacitors across 1115\n- [x] Test relay cricuit - if it works\n- [x] Test relay circuit for voltage spikes\n\nTODO Rev 1.1:\n\n- [x] Rename testpoints\n- [x] Add max V and AMP\n- [x] Add led for relay indicator\n- [x] Add OpenHardware logo and MaxEELabs Logo \n- [x] Add Tooling holes\n- [x] Designators Order\n\nTODO Rev 1.2:\n\n- [x] Prepare to CERN-OHL-S v2\n\nNOTE: \nTME 1kV 330pF https://www.tme.eu/pl/en/details/grm31a7u3a331jw31d/mlcc-smd-capacitors/murata/\n"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
